---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const featuredCases = (await getCollection('case-studies'))
  .filter((c) => c.data.featured)
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.pubDate.valueOf() - a.data.pubDate.valueOf());
---
<Base>
  <header id="top" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 pt-20 pb-16">
    <p class="text-accent font-medium text-sm tracking-wide uppercase mb-4">Bioinformatics for small biotech and academic labs</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">
      The analysis is the easy part.<br />
      <span class="text-accent">We tell you what it means.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
      RNA-seq, scRNA-seq, proteomics, ChIP-seq, ATAC-seq and multi-omics, run end to end by a bioinformatician who reads the biology: what the results say about your system, and where it is worth digging deeper. Fixed price, 7 to 10 business days, reproducible pipelines you can audit.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/case-studies/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-ink text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-md font-medium hover:bg-slate-800 transition">
        See sample reports
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:hello@omicsdesk.com?subject=OmicsDesk%20%E2%80%94%20request%20a%20quote" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-ink border border-slate-200 px-5 py-3 rounded-md font-medium hover:bg-slate-50 transition">
        Request a quote
      </a>
      <a href="/pricing/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600 px-3 py-3 rounded-md font-medium hover:text-ink transition">
        See pricing →
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 py-14 border-t border-slate-100">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">What we do</h2>
    <div class="mt-6 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-4xl">
      <p class="prose-p">
        Running DESeq2 and drawing a volcano plot is the commodity part. The value is the read on top: we turn your raw sequencing or mass spec data into a written interpretation of what stands out for your biology and what to do next, not just a folder of figures. You send a short brief (omics type, samples, contrast), we send back a fixed quote, and you receive a QC report, full statistical results, publication ready figures, and a branded PDF, usually within 7 to 10 business days.
      </p>
      <p class="prose-p">
        Every analysis runs on a versioned Snakemake pipeline with pinned conda environments, and the interpretation is written by a bioinformatician before delivery. You receive the code alongside the results, so the analysis is reproducible and the conclusions are owned by a person you can email. See the same report format on <a class="text-accent font-medium underline-offset-4 hover:underline" href="/case-studies/">real case studies</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="services" class="bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 py-16">
      <div class="flex items-end justify-between flex-wrap gap-4 mb-8">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Services &amp; pricing</h2>
          <p class="prose-p mt-3 max-w-2xl">Flat fees. No surprises. Every analysis includes QC, figures, an Excel workbook, a written PDF report, and the pipeline code we used.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/pricing/" class="text-accent font-medium hover:underline underline-offset-4 text-sm">
          Full pricing &amp; scopes →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-600">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left font-medium px-5 py-3">Omics type</th>
              <th class="text-left font-medium px-5 py-3">Price</th>
              <th class="text-left font-medium px-5 py-3">Up to</th>
              <th class="text-left font-medium px-5 py-3">Turnaround</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
            <tr class="bg-accent/5"><td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">Expert review <span class="text-slate-500 font-normal">(second opinion on results you have)</span></td><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono">€400</td><td class="px-5 py-3">1 dataset</td><td class="px-5 py-3">2 business days</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">RNA-seq (bulk)</td><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono">€2,500</td><td class="px-5 py-3">24 samples</td><td class="px-5 py-3">7 business days</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">scRNA-seq</td><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono">€3,500</td><td class="px-5 py-3">16 libraries</td><td class="px-5 py-3">10 business days</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">Proteomics</td><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono">€3,000</td><td class="px-5 py-3">24 samples</td><td class="px-5 py-3">7 business days</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">Phosphoproteomics</td><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono">€3,500</td><td class="px-5 py-3">24 samples</td><td class="px-5 py-3">10 business days</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">ChIP-seq</td><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono">€2,500</td><td class="px-5 py-3">24 samples</td><td class="px-5 py-3">7 business days</td></tr>
            <tr><td class="px-5 py-3 font-medium">ATAC-seq</td><td class="px-5 py-3 font-mono">€2,500</td><td class="px-5 py-3">24 samples</td><td class="px-5 py-3">7 business days</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
        Prices in EUR. USD invoicing available on request. 15% academic discount for requests from <span class="font-mono text-slate-600">.edu</span> / <span class="font-mono text-slate-600">.ac.*</span> institutional emails (excluding rush).
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how" class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">How it works</h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-accent text-white text-sm font-semibold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Intake &amp; NDA</h3>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">day 0</span>
        </div>
        <p class="prose-p text-sm">You fill a short intake form (organism, sample count, contrasts, data access). NDA signed before any data is shared. Quote and proposal back within 2 business days.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-accent text-white text-sm font-semibold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Analysis &amp; QC</h3>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">days 1–7</span>
        </div>
        <p class="prose-p text-sm">Your data runs through the pipeline, and we look at it. After QC you get a check in: if the design has a problem, we surface it before downstream stats burn the clock.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-accent text-white text-sm font-semibold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <h3 class="font-semibold">Report &amp; handoff</h3>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono">day 7 or 10</span>
        </div>
        <p class="prose-p text-sm">Branded PDF report with a written executive summary and discussion, Excel workbook with full statistical results, figures at 300 dpi, and the pipeline code. Raw data is deleted within 30 days of delivery.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">What you get, every time</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-4xl">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-5">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">QC report</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">HTML + summary table</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-5">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Full statistical results</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">TSV + Excel workbook</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-5">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Publication-ready figures</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">PNG at 300 dpi</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-5">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Branded PDF report</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Executive summary, methods, conclusions</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-5">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">Reproducible pipeline code</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Snakemake + conda, versioned</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-5">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-sm">NDA by default</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">Raw data deleted within 30 days</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 py-16">
    <div class="flex items-end justify-between flex-wrap gap-4 mb-8">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">See real sample reports</h2>
        <p class="prose-p mt-3 max-w-2xl">Two case studies we ran end to end. Same PDF, Excel, and figures format every client receives. Download the full deliverables to see exactly what you would get.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/case-studies/" class="text-accent font-medium hover:underline underline-offset-4 text-sm">
        All case studies →
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      {featuredCases.map((cs) => (
        <a
          href={`/case-studies/${cs.slug}/`}
          class="group block bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden hover:border-accent transition"
        >
          <div class="aspect-[16/10] bg-slate-50 overflow-hidden border-b border-slate-100">
            <img src={cs.data.heroImage} alt={cs.data.heroAlt} class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition" />
          </div>
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-3">
              <span class="bg-accent/10 text-accent px-2 py-0.5 rounded-sm">{cs.data.omicsType}</span>
              <span>·</span>
              <span>{cs.data.sampleCount}</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight leading-snug group-hover:text-accent transition">{cs.data.title}</h3>
            <p class="prose-p mt-3 text-sm">{cs.data.problem}</p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-accent font-medium">Read case study →</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 py-16 border-t border-slate-100">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h2>
    <p class="prose-p mt-6 max-w-3xl">
      I'm <span class="font-semibold text-ink">Alessandro De Santis</span>. I lead OmicsDesk and co-founded SynMiR, an Italian biotech developing synthetic miRNA cancer therapeutics. Day to day I run multi omics target discovery at SynMiR: transcriptomics, proteomics, phosphoproteomics, and mutation data combined into patient specific signaling networks. OmicsDesk brings the same workflow to small biotechs and academic labs that need an answer from their data without hiring a full time bioinformatician.
    </p>
    <p class="prose-p mt-4 max-w-3xl">
      Every project is run, reviewed, and written up with expert interpretation. The pipelines are reproducible, so the code is shareable. The conclusions are written by us, so you have someone to ask about them.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-100">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Get a quote</h2>
      <p class="prose-p mt-3 max-w-2xl">
        Email a short brief (omics type, sample count, the biological contrast you want tested) and a fixed quote comes back within 2 business days. NDA before any data is shared.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold">Request a quote</h4>
            <p class="prose-p mt-2 text-sm">Tell us what you measured and what you want compared — we send back a quote and a plan. You upload data after the quote is signed, not before.</p>
            <ul class="prose-p mt-4 text-sm space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside text-slate-600">
              <li>Omics type and sample count</li>
              <li>Species and genome build (if known)</li>
              <li>The biological contrast you want tested</li>
              <li>Any deadline you're working against</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <a href="mailto:hello@omicsdesk.com?subject=OmicsDesk%20%E2%80%94%20request%20a%20quote" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-ink text-white px-5 py-3 rounded-md font-medium hover:bg-slate-800 transition self-start">
            Email hello@omicsdesk.com
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-semibold">Already have a signed quote?</h4>
            <p class="prose-p mt-2 text-sm">
              Once scope is agreed and the kickoff invoice is paid, the intake agent at <a class="text-accent font-medium underline-offset-4 hover:underline" href="https://submit.omicsdesk.com/">submit.omicsdesk.com</a> walks through experimental-design confirmation and the upload step.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="https://submit.omicsdesk.com/" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-slate-300 text-ink px-5 py-3 rounded-md font-medium hover:bg-slate-100 transition self-start">
            Submit your data
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
